Z||000000||StuGood||01-24-2001||06:58 PM||||Looks as though I'll be moving up to the  Everett, WA area in a few days  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I need to find a place to roost, hopefully with a garage.  Suggestions/ leads to help steer me towards a place for rent (preferably a small house)would be appreciated  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. <P>When was there a few years ago, I lived in a townhome on Casino Road a little west of Evergreen Way (on south side of Casino).  I liked it, and would probably stay there again, if any are available - I don't have a telephone number to call and inquire, though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.  The name of the place was "126 W. Estates," - if anyone happens to have their number, please e-mail me.<BR> <BR>Otherwise, I'll rent an apartment somewhere.  (Sigh) - houses with garages have spoiled me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Looking forward to living in the Northwest again.  Thanks in advance  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">          <BR> <P>||||reg||6
