Z||000010||StuGood||03-26-2001||08:11 PM||||Why not?  Land's cheaper there...  Boeing can then sell off Renton and Everett into residential lots (and I <B>do</B> mean lots   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ), and make a fortune!  She should at <B> least</B> keep Seattle as the "showroom," and final delivery point - it's too beautiful to let go! <P>One thing I thought was pretty cool, though, is that everyone here wasn't up in arms when the newpapers talked about plans to move some of the 757 production to Wichita.  No lynch mobs after "those dang flatlanders," or anything   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.  Pretty cool people, for the most part   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 03-26-2001).]||||reg||6
