Z||000012||Nashco||03-27-2001||07:34 PM||||I hope you like it StuGood.  I moved away from home (Snohomish, right next to Everett) for college, and don't get back much.  I loved it there, I don't care what you say about rain <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Oh, I second that about molding before rusting too!  I hate seeing so many rusted cars here in Michigan.  Not so bad in Alabama though.  Later.<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT<P>P.S.  I'm trying out the signature, just a generic pic, crossing my fingers...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/centerconsoletest.jpg"> ||||reg||1
